  m_text: 'The year is 199X. You arrive at your job at Cinemare, a video store for
    horses.


    Listen to each customer as they come in to get a feel for their
    tastes. Then, recommend the movie closest to what you think they might like.


    At
    the end of the night, you will get a performance review showing how you did.


    Good
    luck!'
